Z||000003||SloPonti||01-15-2000||05:17 PM||||Yes i am old enough to drive and in fact i am 21 now! my father is 43 or 44-not sure! the heat sheild is fastend on both ends of the sheild so that way no rattling! i hate that! also i would like to try to dyno it! right now i am in collage to become ase certified mechanic and i am alost done! the program i am in is thinking about adding a dyno class-which i hope they do so i can get my car in there!<BR>thanks<BR>Rob||||reg||10
Z||000004||Sage||01-15-2000||06:03 PM||||<B>VERY</B> nice!  Looks like you took your time, did it right and will be able to enjoy the benefits for years to come.  Also great to see a dad and son doing a worthwhile project together.  I'm impressed.  Keep up the good work, and before long I will be trying to get you to help solve my automotive dilemas!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> (Well that wore me out so guess I'll go take a nap too.)||||reg||14
