Z||000006||SloPonti||01-16-2000||12:58 AM||||it is hard to rate this project! i have been around so many people at the college that are very very noligable! this has helped me alot! also my knowlodge is a little more than the average person my age because of the experiances i have had! but i think for the average do it yourselfer you could get by with this! it never hurts to get information and talk to everyone you know before you start a project like this! gather all of your info and then decide what you think is best! thanks guys!<BR>Rob||||reg||6
